    ["guy at the gas station bit the cashier. [cops came|ambulance came]. nobody knows whats going on"] = "加油站有个人咬了收银员。[警察来了|救护车来了]。没人知道怎么回事",
    ["National Guard is setting up at the [armory|fairgrounds]. Stay off 31W"] = "国民警卫队正在[军械库|集市场地]设点。别上31W",
    ["Mall closing early. Corporate's orders. Call before you come in tomorrow"] = "商场提前关门。公司的命令。明天来之前先打电话",
    ["heard [gunshots|fireworks] by the [mall|river] just now. dad got the shotgun out of the closet"] = "刚才听到[枪声|烟花声]从[商场|河边]那边传来。爸把霰弹枪从柜子里拿出来了",
    ["my mom's filling the tub with water. canned food everywhere. she wont say why"] = "我妈在往浴缸里放水。到处都是罐头食品。她不肯说为什么",
    ["star-e-plex cancelled every show. sign on the door. [weirdest 4th ever|manager just left]"] = "star-e-plex取消了所有场次。门上贴了告示。[史上最怪的七月四日|经理刚走]",
    ["Rev. Lois opened the pantry to anybody. Line's at the side door. [Bring bags|Come early]"] = "洛伊丝牧师把食品储藏室向所有人开放了。队伍排到侧门。[带上袋子|早点来]",
    ["theres a list up at the methodist church. people nobody can find. [go look|i looked. go look]"] = "卫理公会教堂贴出了一份名单。是没人找得到的人。[去看看|我看过了。你去看看]",
    ["A deputy came by asking about the [Millers|Hendersons|Parkers]. Wrote something down and left"] = "一位副警长来问过[米勒家|亨德森家|帕克家]。写了点东西就走了",
    ["Lois says [seven|nine] families won't answer their doors. She's scared. [So am I|We should help]"] = "洛伊丝说有[七|九]家人不应门。她害怕了。[我也是|我们应该帮忙]",
    ["The list at the church got longer today. Lois added [three|four] names after lunch"] = "教堂的名单今天又长了。洛伊丝午饭后添了[三|四]个名字",
    ["soldiers at the old bunker gate. wouldnt say why. [just stood there|turned us around]"] = "士兵守在旧地堡的大门口。不肯说为什么。[就站在那儿|把我们劝回来了]",
    ["Landlines are down across the county. Knox Mobile's still up. Use the cell"] = "全县座机都断了。Knox Mobile还能用。用手机",
    ["All circuits are busy every time I call your mother. Texts go through. Keep yours on"] = "每次打你妈妈的电话都是线路全忙。短信能发出去。你的手机别关",
    ["Called the phone company. Dot answered. She sounded [so tired|hoarse]. Been there since [yesterday|Tuesday]"] = "给电话公司打了电话。多特接的。她听起来[累极了|嗓子哑了]。从[昨天|周二]就在那儿了",
    ["one bar [at the window|by the chimney]. texts go through after [3|4] tries. calls never"] = "[窗边|烟囱旁]有一格信号。短信试[3|4]次才发得出去。电话从来打不通",
    ["Louisville office isn't answering. The test phones are the only ones still activating. [Don't ask me why|Ray says wait]"] = "路易斯维尔办公室没人接。只有测试机还能激活。[别问我为什么|雷说等等]",
    ["watch channel 3. theyre saying people are biting people in louisville. [at the hospital|downtown]"] = "看3频道。他们说路易斯维尔有人咬人。[在医院|在市中心]",
    ["Come home [right now|before dark]. The news says lock your doors. Your father's getting gas"] = "[马上|天黑前]回家。新闻说锁好门。你爸去加油了",
    ["fireworks cancelled. [army trucks|cops] blocking the bridge. everybody's leaving and nobody knows why"] = "烟花取消了。[军用卡车|警察]堵着桥。大家都在走，没人知道为什么",
    ["saw [smoke|lights] toward the [plant|base]. [explosions|gunshots] maybe. dont tell ur parents"] = "看到[烟|灯光]朝[工厂|基地]那边。可能是[爆炸|枪声]。别告诉你爸妈",
    ["News says the Louisville ER is full. Don't open the door for anybody. [Kids are inside|I locked the gate]"] = "新闻说路易斯维尔急诊室满了。谁来敲门都别开。[孩子们在屋里|我把大门锁了]",
    ["The IGA is out of formula. Try the gas station. Or the Kroger on Dixie"] = "IGA没有婴儿配方奶粉了。去加油站试试。或者Dixie上的Kroger",
    ["All circuits busy. Can't reach the [daycare|camp]. Text me the second you hear anything"] = "线路全忙。联系不上[日托|营地]。一有消息马上发短信给我",
    ["Kids have been in the basement since 8. Sirens outside. [We're playing go fish|They think it's a storm drill]"] = "孩子们从8点就待在地下室。外面有警笛。[我们在玩钓鱼牌|他们以为是暴风雨演习]",
    ["All hands to the hospital by 0500. Wear what you've got. Triage at the side door"] = "所有人5点前到医院。有什么穿什么。分诊在侧门",
    ["The church needs cooks for the shelter kitchen. If you can't work, go there. They'll feed you"] = "教会需要人给收容所厨房做饭。如果你没法上班，去那儿。他们管饭",
    ["Staying open all night for the checkpoint crews. Grill only. Tips split at shift end"] = "为检查站的人通宵营业。只开烤架。下班时分小费",
    ["my [cousin|roommate] works at the hospital. says its bad. she wont come home"] = "我的[表姐|室友]在医院工作。说情况很糟。她不肯回家",
    ["Store's cleaned out. No water, no bread. I'm filling the tub now"] = "店里被搬空了。没水，没面包。我现在在往浴缸里放水",
    ["Power flickered downtown. I've got candles out. [The kids think it's fun|Hurry home]"] = "市中心的电闪了一下。我把蜡烛拿出来了。[孩子们觉得好玩|快回家]",
    ["dad says the plant locked the gates. he's stuck inside. [dont panic|come to moms]"] = "爸说工厂把大门锁了。他被困在里面。[别慌|来妈妈家]",
    ["the church is open to everybody. mom wants us there. wedding's [off|postponed] obviously"] = "教堂对所有人开放。妈妈要我们去。婚礼当然[取消|推迟]了",
    ["IGA's cleaned out. i grabbed [two cases of water|what i could]. come to my place"] = "IGA被搬空了。我拿了[两箱水|能拿的]。来我这儿",
    ["Channel 3 says the hospital downtown is locked down. [Call me|Text me back] right now"] = "3频道说市中心的医院封锁了。马上[给我打电话|回我短信]",
    ["somebody got bit at the kroger on dixie. cops everywhere. [dont go|stay inside]"] = "有人在Dixie的Kroger被咬了。到处都是警察。[别去|待在屋里]",
    ["All units to the bridges. The Guard is taking over downtown. Report to {jobPlace}"] = "所有单位去守桥。警卫队正在接管市中心。到{jobPlace}报到",
    ["The mayor's on TV at [noon|6]. They're saying curfew. Fill the tub while the water's on"] = "市长[中午|6点]上电视。他们说要宵禁。趁还有水把浴缸放满",
    ["amusement park's closed. fence going up. sirens nonstop by broadway"] = "游乐园关了。围栏正在架起来。Broadway那边警笛不停",
    ["Tony can't get to the hospital. Abandoned cars on [9th|3rd]. He's [turning back|staying at the shop]"] = "托尼去不了医院。[9th|3rd]上全是弃车。他[掉头回去了|留在店里]",
    ["pondview is out of water and bleach. truck didnt come. fill your tubs tonight"] = "Pondview的水和漂白剂没了。货车没来。今晚把浴缸都灌满",
    ["heard [gunshots|screaming] down by the ferry dock around 2am. anybody else"] = "凌晨2点左右听到渡口码头那边有[枪声|尖叫声]。还有人听到吗",
    ["Closing at 6. No deliveries, the trucks are stopped at the county line. Don't come in"] = "6点关门。不送货，卡车在县界被拦下了。别来了",
    ["The board's been lit up since 4 this morning. Everybody's calling Louisville. Come in if you can, hon"] = "总机从早上4点起就一直亮着灯。大家都在打路易斯维尔。能来的话就来吧，亲爱的",
    ["Management says keep the board staffed through Sunday. Double time. Bring a bag and your good shoes"] = "管理层说周日前总机要一直有人值班。双倍工资。带个包，再带双好鞋",
    ["The news says Louisville closed its schools. Our principal hasn't said a word"] = "新闻说路易斯维尔的学校停课了。我们校长一个字都没说",
    ["The school opens as a shelter tomorrow. We need cots and blankets at {jobPlace} by noon"] = "学校明天开放为收容所。中午前我们需要在{jobPlace}备好行军床和毯子",
    ["The janitor has every key and won't leave the building. The principal yelled at him. He just locked the office"] = "清洁工拿着所有钥匙，不肯离开这栋楼。校长对他吼了。他直接把办公室锁了",
    ["The school shelter was full by 6. They turned people away at the gate"] = "学校收容所6点就满了。他们在大门口把人拒之门外",
    ["Power flickered at {jobPlace}. The freezer held. Boss says lock up if it drops again"] = "{jobPlace}的电闪了一下。冰柜撑住了。老板说如果再断就锁门",
    ["Marcus says don't believe the radio. It's not what it looks like. That's all he'd say"] = "马库斯说别信电台。事情不是看起来那样。他只肯说这么多",
    ["Danny's unit got moved to the line. He texted we're holding. I turned the news off"] = "丹尼的部队被调到防线上了。他发短信说我们守住了。我把新闻关了",
    ["dad said they brought the sick inside the wire. delete this. hes scared and he never gets scared"] = "爸说他们把病人带进了铁丝网里。把这条删了。他很害怕，他从来不怕的",
    ["flares over the base all night. you can see them from my window. the dogs wont stop"] = "基地上空整夜都是照明弹。从我窗户能看到。狗叫个不停",
    ["Marcus's CO came by the house for his spare gear. Wouldn't look me in the eye"] = "马库斯的连长来家里拿他的备用装备。不肯正眼看我",
    ["Channel 3 says animals are acting strange in Louisville. Keep yours inside"] = "3频道说路易斯维尔的动物行为反常。把你家的关在屋里",
    ["the shelter at the school wont take pets. people are leaving dogs tied to the fence"] = "学校的收容所不收宠物。有人把狗拴在围栏上就走了",
    ["Channel 3 says the Louisville ERs are turning people away. Some kind of virus. They won't name it"] = "3频道说路易斯维尔的急诊室在拒收病人。是某种病毒。他们不肯说叫什么",
    ["Somebody at the feed store swears it was a chemical spill at [the plant|the base]. Nobody official is saying anything"] = "饲料店有人发誓那是[工厂|基地]的化学品泄漏。官方没人说话",
    ["the tv guy said [a new rabies|a mutated flu]. spreads by biting. [turn it off|change the channel]"] = "电视上那人说是[一种新型狂犬病|一种变异流感]。靠咬传播。[把它关了|换个台]",
    ["A preacher on the radio says it's judgment on the land. Your mother cried. I turned it off"] = "电台里一个传教士说这是对这片土地的审判。你妈妈哭了。我把它关了",
    ["the news lady stopped in the middle of a sentence. dead air. then the emergency tone. did u see it"] = "新闻女主播话说到一半就停了。一片死寂。然后是紧急警报音。你看到了吗",
    ["A doctor on channel 3 said don't come to the ER. We can't help you. Her voice broke on the last part"] = "3频道一位医生说别来急诊室。我们帮不了你。最后一句她的声音哽住了",
    ["The radio says the Guard is moving down 31W. They're calling it a quarantine zone. Nobody in or out"] = "电台说警卫队正沿31W推进。他们称之为隔离区。任何人不得进出",
    ["Our supplier in Louisville says the warehouses are sealed. Government order. We're on our own"] = "我们在路易斯维尔的供应商说仓库被封了。政府命令。我们只能靠自己了",
    ["News helicopter over the river. The reporter said there are people in the water. Then they cut away"] = "新闻直升机飞在河上。记者说水里有人。然后画面就切走了",
    ["Earl says there were green clouds over the base last night. Something blew. The wind's coming our way"] = "厄尔说昨晚基地上空有绿色的云。有什么炸了。风正朝我们这边吹",
    ["The governor's on at 8. They're saying emergency powers. Fill every container we have"] = "州长8点讲话。他们说要启用紧急权力。把我们所有的容器都装满",
    ["The church opened its doors to everybody. Cots in the fellowship hall. Your father went to help"] = "教堂向所有人敞开了大门。团契大厅里有行军床。你爸去帮忙了",
    ["the prayer chain blew up. [30|40] names since noon. they're reading them out before dark"] = "祷告链炸了。中午以来有[30|40]个名字。他们要在天黑前念出来",
    ["grandmas church group is making sandwiches for the shelter. no bread anywhere. they need peanut butter"] = "奶奶的教会小组在为收容所做三明治。哪儿都买不到面包。他们需要花生酱",
    ["Earl's CB went quiet after 2am. The last thing he said was Psalm 91. Static since"] = "厄尔的CB电台凌晨2点后就没声了。他说的最后一句是诗篇91篇。之后一直是杂音",
    ["Wednesday supper is cancelled. The kitchen's cooking for the shelter. Come help at 4 if you can"] = "周三的晚餐取消了。厨房在为收容所做饭。方便的话4点来帮忙",
    ["news says louisville hospitals are turning people away. is our date still on?"] = "新闻说路易斯维尔的医院在拒收病人。我们的约会还作数吗？",
    ["saw {partner} at the kroger with somebody. didnt see her face. they grabbed water and left"] = "在Kroger看到{partner}跟一个人在一起。没看清她的脸。他们拿了水就走了",
    ["{partner} called the house [twice|three times] looking for you. Call them back"] = "{partner}往家里打了[两次|三次]电话找你。给他们回个电话",
    ["fireworks [ended early|got called off]. [sirens|gunshots] over the music. [get home|stay inside]"] = "烟花[提前结束了|被叫停了]。音乐声里夹着[警笛声|枪声]。[快回家|待在屋里]",
    ["Dot at the phone company says the lines lit up all night. [Text, don't call|Calls won't go through]"] = "电话公司的多特说线路整夜都亮着。[发短信，别打电话|电话打不通]",
    ["trish says dont come to the ER [no matter what|for anything]. [shes sleeping there|double shift again]"] = "特里什说别去急诊室，[无论如何都别去|什么事都别去]。[她睡在那儿了|又是双倍班]",
    ["[ran into|talked to] a soldier at the gas station. [he wouldnt say anything|he said go home]. trucks all over 31W"] = "在加油站[碰见了一个士兵|跟一个士兵说话了]。[他什么也不肯说|他说回家去]。31W上全是卡车",
    ["the party at west maple [broke up|cleared out] early. [somebody got sick|a man collapsed] on the patio"] = "West Maple的派对很早就[散了|清场了]。露台上[有人病倒了|一个男人晕倒了]",
    ["[going out|heading to] the [pharmacy|igA] for medicine. if i dont 6 dont come"] = "[出门去|正赶往][药店|IGA]买药。要是我6点没消息别来",
    ["[fever|temp] [broke|dropped] at 3 am. sweat soaked the sheets. feel cold now"] = "凌晨3点[烧|体温][退了|降了]。汗把床单都浸透了。现在觉得冷",
    ["got the [keys|cash] from the [coffee can|top shelf]. tank's full. leaving tonight. dont wake anyone"] = "拿了[钥匙|现金]，在[咖啡罐|最上层的架子]里。油箱加满了。今晚走。别叫醒任何人",
    ["hid the [receipt|box] in the [dryer|vent|toolbox]. hank called ready. paid cash"] = "把[收据|盒子]藏在[烘干机|通风口|工具箱]里了。汉克打来说好了。付的现金",
    ["told [partner|mom] [im|i'm] working late. really meeting lonnie at the truck stop"] = "跟[对象|妈妈]说[我|我]在加班。其实是去卡车休息站找朗尼",
    ["[wrote|left] the [note|list] in the cookbook. water under the sink. for them"] = "[写好|留下]的[便条|清单]在食谱里。水在水槽下面。留给他们的",
    ["the [collection|repo] [call|letter] came today. 30 days. sold the watch. nobody knows"] = "[催收|收车][电话|信]今天来了。30天。表卖了。没人知道",
    ["locked the [bedroom|basement] door from [outside|inside]. he stopped moaning an hour ago. sit with him"] = "把[卧室|地下室]的门从[外面|里面]锁上了。他一小时前就不呻吟了。去陪陪他",
    ["[kayla|bobby] [texted|called] scared. turned back at the fence. told her im fine. lied"] = "[凯拉|鲍比][发短信|打电话]来，吓坏了。在围栏那儿被劝回来了。我跟她说我没事。撒谎了",
    ["[going to look for water|going out for medicine]. if i dont text by 6 dont come looking"] = "[去找水|出门买药]。如果我6点前没发短信，别来找我",
    ["the scratch is nothing. [dont tell mom|dont tell the kids]"] = "划伤没什么。[别告诉妈妈|别告诉孩子们]",
    ["im going to sit with [him|her] a while. [its quiet here|the door is locked]"] = "我去陪[他|她]坐一会儿。[这里很安静|门锁着]",
    ["[heading to the IGA|going for the truck]. back before dark"] = "[去IGA|去取卡车]。天黑前回来",
    ["dont wait up. [checking on the neighbor|gonna see about the generator]"] = "别等我。[去看看邻居|去看看发电机]",
    ["bike chain snapped. walking home from [31W|the lumberyard]. its fine"] = "自行车链条断了。从[31W|木材场]走路回家。没事的",
    ["Took my pills. Sitting on the porch watching the road"] = "吃了药。坐在门廊上看着路",
    ["travis didnt show. going to his place [the back way|by the river road]"] = "特拉维斯没来。我去他家，走[小路|河边那条路]",
    ["dog wont stop barking at [the basement door|the back fence]. probably a raccoon"] = "狗对着[地下室的门|后围栏]叫个不停。多半是浣熊",
    ["ambulance never came. driving her myself. [taking the back roads|dont call]"] = "救护车一直没来。我自己开车送她。[走小路|别打电话]",
    ["chained the gate. keep the kids inside [no matter what|till i get back]"] = "把大门拴上了。[无论如何|等我回来之前]让孩子们待在屋里",
    ["The pastor came by and prayed with me. Said the church is full. I'm all right here"] = "牧师来过，陪我祈祷了。说教堂满了。我在这儿挺好的",
    ["nailed boards over the [bedroom|kitchen] window. [told the kids its a game|kids are asleep]"] = "用木板把[卧室|厨房]的窗钉上了。[告诉孩子们这是游戏|孩子们睡了]",
    ["I wrote the grandkids' names in the family Bible. [Just in case|So they know]"] = "我把孙子孙女的名字写在家庭圣经里了。[以防万一|让他们知道]",
    ["nobody came to relieve me. been here [16 hours|since 6 this morning]. still here"] = "没人来换班。已经在这儿[16小时了|从今早6点起]。还在这儿",
    ["told the kids we're camping. [they believed me|the little one didnt]"] = "跟孩子们说我们是去露营。[他们信了|小的不信]",
    ["the siren started again. [lost count today|i stopped counting]"] = "警报又响了。[今天数不清响了几次|我数不过来了]",
    ["going down to the [cellar|barn] to check the stores. be right back"] = "下[地窖|谷仓]去看看存货。马上回来",
    ["[made it to|im at] {jobPlace}. door's locked from the inside. ill wait here"] = "[我到了|我在]{jobPlace}。门从里面锁上了。我在这儿等",
    ["tell {mom} i love her. [i didnt say it enough|tell her im sorry about easter]"] = "告诉{mom}我爱她。[我说得还不够多|告诉她我为复活节的事道歉]",
    ["the kids are at [my sisters|grandmas]. if anybody asks thats where they are. [dont come here|stay there]"] = "孩子们在[我姐姐家|奶奶家]。如果有人问，他们就在那儿。[别来这儿|待在那儿]",
    ["battery's [almost gone|on one bar]. [the radio says|they keep saying] stay inside. so im staying inside"] = "电池[快没电了|只剩一格]。[电台说|他们一直说]待在屋里。所以我待在屋里",
    ["[cant stop shaking|so cold]. its july and im under 2 blankets. probably nothing"] = "[停不住地发抖|好冷]。现在是七月，我盖着两条毯子。多半没事",
    ["if u see my car at the [IGA|lumberyard] dont stop. just keep going ok"] = "如果你看到我的车在[IGA|木材场]，别停。继续走，好吗",
    ["left the dog [with the neighbors|at the church]. [her name is Daisy|she likes the porch]"] = "把狗[留给邻居了|放在教堂了]。[她叫黛西|她喜欢门廊]",
    ["the spare key is [in the coffee can|under the gnome]. [take what you need|everything in the pantry is yours]"] = "备用钥匙[在咖啡罐里|在小矮人摆件下面]。[需要什么尽管拿|储藏室里的东西都是你的]",
    ["somebody keeps trying the back door. [i turned the lights off|im in the bathroom]. text dont call"] = "有人一直在试后门。[我把灯关了|我在浴室]。发短信，别打电话",
    ["I fed the cat and locked up. I'm going to sit on the porch a while. It's a pretty evening"] = "我喂了猫，锁好了门。我要在门廊坐一会儿。今晚的傍晚很美",
    ["[still here|on shift]. we stopped counting. [dont wait up|kiss the kids for me]"] = "[还在这儿|在上班]。我们已经数不清了。[别等我|替我亲亲孩子们]",
    ["i wrapped it real tight. its fine. [just tired|gonna lie down a minute]"] = "我包得很紧。没事的。[只是累了|我躺一会儿]",
    ["[found|got] a ride with some guys from the plant. theyre going [south|to the river]. ill text when i can"] = "[找到|搭上]了工厂几个人的车。他们要去[南边|河边]。有机会我再发短信",
    ["[sorry about|forget about] the fight. it was stupid. [none of it matters|i was wrong]"] = "那次吵架，[对不起|忘了吧]。太蠢了。[一切都不重要了|是我错了]",
    ["{partner} if you get this, [the money's in the freezer|the papers are in the safe]. [I love you|Take care of them]"] = "{partner}，如果你收到这条，[钱在冰柜里|文件在保险箱里]。[我爱你|照顾好他们]",
    ["[taking|driving] the back way to the [pondview|IGA]. [car's|tank's] almost empty. wish me luck"] = "[走|开车走]小路去[Pondview|IGA]。[车|油箱]快空了。祝我好运",
    ["{first} please. [Just one word|Just say ok]"] = "{first}，拜托了。[只要一个字|回个OK就行]",
    ["[came by|knocked] your place. door was open. [where did u go|call me]"] = "[来过|敲过]你家。门是开着的。[你去哪了|给我打电话]",
    ["[I kept dinner warm|I left the porch light on]. I know. I'm leaving it on anyway"] = "[我把晚饭一直热着|我把门廊灯留着了]。我知道。反正我还是留着",
    ["{first} you are listed missing. [Answer if you can|Radio in if you can]"] = "{first}，你被列为失踪。[能回的话请回话|能的话请用电台呼叫]",
    ["The truck's fixed. Keys are on the hook. Come get it whenever. Love, Dad"] = "卡车修好了。钥匙挂在钩子上。随时来取。爱你的爸爸",
    ["The church ladies asked about you. I said you're [busy|working]. Call me please"] = "教会的太太们问起你。我说你[忙|在工作]。请给我打电话",
    ["moms freaking out. she made [3 pans of brownies|your bed twice]. just text back"] = "妈快急疯了。她[做了3盘布朗尼|把你的床铺了两遍]。回个短信吧",
    ["The kids keep asking. I told them you're at work. [Please come home|Don't make me a liar]"] = "孩子们一直在问。我告诉他们你在上班。[请回家|别让我变成骗子]",
    ["[bobby|travis] came by looking for you. didnt say why. hit me up"] = "[鲍比|特拉维斯]来找过你。没说为什么。回我",
    ["{first}, we need you [tomorrow|Saturday]. Half the crew's out. Text back if you're coming"] = "{first}，我们[明天|周六]需要你。一半人手都不在。要来的话回个短信",
    ["Your [car payment|insurance bill] came. I put it by the phone. Let me know you got it"] = "你的[车贷|保险账单]来了。我放在电话旁边。收到了告诉我一声",
    ["Heard gunshots by [the river|the plant] last night. Don't go looking. Your mother's worried sick"] = "昨晚[河边|工厂]那边有枪声。别去看。你妈妈担心死了",
    ["Power flickered [twice|three times]. Lanterns are out. Come home please"] = "电闪了[两次|三次]。提灯拿出来了。请回家",
    ["{first}, you're on the board for tonight. Confirm by radio. [Now|Please]"] = "{first}，今晚你在值班表上。用电台确认。[现在|拜托了]",
    ["Your name's on the prayer chain. I told them you're fine. Please call so I'm not lying to church people"] = "你的名字在祷告链上。我告诉他们你没事。请打电话，免得我对教会的人撒谎",
    ["found your keys on the porch. screen door was open. [where are you|this isnt funny]"] = "在门廊上找到了你的钥匙。纱门是开着的。[你在哪|这不好笑]",
    ["The baby's fever broke. [I need you here|We need you]. I need you to see her"] = "宝宝退烧了。[我需要你在这儿|我们需要你]。我需要你来看看她",
    ["Grandma fell [yesterday|Tuesday]. She keeps asking for you. [Just call her|Call her please]"] = "奶奶[昨天|周二]摔了。她一直问起你。[给她打个电话就好|请给她打电话]",
    ["the guard set up at the [school|fairgrounds]. they took our names and asked where u live. [i didnt know what to say|i said here]"] = "警卫队在[学校|集市场地]设点了。他们登记了我们的名字，还问你住哪儿。[我不知道该说什么|我说就是这儿]",
    ["I packed the car. We're going to {hometown}. [Come find us|I'll wait as long as I can]"] = "我把车装好了。我们去{hometown}。[来找我们|我会尽可能等]",
    ["The siren at the plant went off at 3am. Ran an hour. Your mother didn't sleep. Neither did I"] = "工厂的警报凌晨3点响了。响了一个小时。你妈妈没睡。我也没睡",
    ["The dog won't stop staring at the back door. Deadbolt's thrown. Text me so I know you're ok"] = "狗一直盯着后门。插销闩上了。发短信给我，让我知道你没事",
    ["rev lois is writing down names of people who didnt come home. ur not on it. [dont be|call]"] = "洛伊丝牧师在写没回家的人的名字。你不在上面。[别让自己上去|打电话来]",
    ["The [cherry|apple] pie is cooling. I saved you a slice. Just come home. Love, Mom"] = "[樱桃|苹果]派在晾着。给你留了一块。回家吧。爱你的妈妈",
    ["I made [your favorite|the potato salad] in case you come. Your plate's in the fridge"] = "我做了[你最爱吃的|土豆沙拉]，万一你来呢。你的饭在冰箱里",
    ["dude [ur mom|ur sister] keeps calling me. text her back. [seriously|please]"] = "哥们，[你妈|你姐]一直给我打电话。回她短信。[真的|拜托了]",
    ["Drove by your place. [Car's there|Lights are off]. Knocked. I'll try again tomorrow"] = "开车经过你家。[车在|灯都关着]。敲了门。明天再试试",
    ["[i'm not mad anymore|forget the money]. just answer"] = "[我不生气了|钱的事算了]。回一下就行",
    ["[I'm at the church|We're at the school] if you're looking for us. They have a list. Your name's on it"] = "你要找我们的话，[我在教堂|我们在学校]。他们有名单。你的名字在上面",
    ["Someone said they saw you at the [gas station|IGA]. Was it you? Just say yes or no"] = "有人说在[加油站|IGA]看到你了。是你吗？回答是或不是就行",
    ["[your truck's|your bike's] still out front. i'm leaving it there. u'll want it"] = "[你的卡车|你的自行车]还停在门口。我就让它放那儿。你会用得上的",
    ["{first} you missed [two|three] shifts. Not mad. Just let me know you're ok"] = "{first}，你缺了[两|三]个班。没生气。只是让我知道你没事",
    ["Your mother wants you to know she's [praying|keeping a candle lit]. So am I. Call"] = "你妈妈想让你知道她在[祈祷|点着蜡烛]。我也是。打个电话",
    ["i fed [ur fish|the cat]. its fine. i'll keep doing it. [come home|text me]"] = "我喂了[你的鱼|猫]。没事的。我会一直喂。[回家吧|给我发短信]",
    ["The baby said [dada|mama] today. I wanted you to know"] = "宝宝今天说了[爸爸|妈妈]。我想让你知道",
    ["[going to the river|heading to the school] tonight with everybody. [we'll wait for u|left a note on ur door]"] = "今晚大家一起[去河边|去学校]。[我们等你|在你门上留了张字条]",
    ["Happy birthday sweetheart. I didn't forget. [I won't forget|I'll keep the cake]"] = "生日快乐，宝贝。我没忘。[我不会忘|我给你留着蛋糕]",
    ["Paycheck is in the office if you want it. [Door's unlocked|The manager has it]"] = "工资在办公室，想要就来拿。[门没锁|经理那儿有]",
    ["{first}, [call your mother|answer your mother]. She's [beside herself|not sleeping]"] = "{first}，[给你妈妈打电话|回你妈妈的电话]。她[急得不行|睡不着]",
    ["The kids keep asking when you're coming home. [I don't know what to say|I said soon]"] = "孩子们一直问你什么时候回家。[我不知道该说什么|我说快了]",
    ["{first}, [payroll|the office] needs your hours. [Call when you can|Is everything ok?]"] = "{first}，[工资部门|办公室]需要你的工时。[有空打电话|一切都好吗？]",
}
